{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40496","headline":"梢云 · 曹松","name":"梢云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殊质资灵贶，陵空发瑞云。\n梢梢含树影，郁郁动霞文。\n不比因风起，全非触石分。\n叶光闲泛灩，枝彩静氛氲。\n隐见心无宰，裴回庆自君。\n翻飞如可托，长愿在横汾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}